<title>UK: SOCCER-SWEDEN INTERNATIONAL LIMPAR JOINS BIRMINGHAM.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWEDEN INTERNATIONAL LIMPAR JOINS BIRMINGHAM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish international winger Anders Limpar joined English first division Birmingham from Everton on Friday.</p>
<p>Limpar plans to return to Sweden at the end of the season but Birmingham manager Trevor Francis said he hoped to persuade him to stay longer.</p>
<p>&quot;Limpar will give us one or two more options up front,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
